  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssign>无法分配{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssign>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.SelectedName>已选择{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.SelectedName>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.DeselectedName>已取消选择{0}。</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.DeselectedName>
